```mermaid
erDiagram
  profiles ||--o{ technician_categories : "訂閱"
  categories ||--o{ technician_categories : "被訂閱"
  categories ||--o{ tickets : "分類"
  buildings ||--o{ spaces : "包含"
  spaces ||--o{ equipment : "安裝於"
  spaces |o--o{ tickets : "所在空間"
  buildings |o--o{ tickets : "所在地點"
  equipment |o--o{ tickets : "相關設備"
  profiles |o--o{ tickets : "受指派"
  tickets ||--o{ ticket_photos : "佐證照片"

  profiles {
    uuid id PK
    text user_role
    text display_name
    bool is_active
  }
  categories {
    uuid id PK
    text name
    bool is_active
  }
  technician_categories {
    uuid technician_id PK_FK
    uuid category_id PK_FK
  }
  tickets {
    uuid id PK
    enum status
    uuid category_id FK
    uuid space_id FK_NULL
    uuid building_id FK_NULL
    uuid equipment_id FK_NULL
    uuid assigned_to FK_NULL
    int rating
  }
  buildings {
    uuid id PK
    text name
    text code
  }
  spaces {
    uuid id PK
    text name
    int floor
    uuid building_id FK
  }
  equipment {
    uuid id PK
    text code
    date purchase_date
    date warranty_expiry
    uuid space_id FK
  }
  ticket_photos {
    uuid id PK
    uuid ticket_id FK
    enum phase
    text storage_path
  }
```

說明：工單為聚合根；`space_id`／`building_id`／`equipment_id`／`assigned_to` 可為空，
因此圖中選配關係以虛線表示。`ticket_notes`（含 status_change 記事）與
`notification_log`（通知派送帳）未畫入本圖。
